# imab — "i'm a butterfly" · dance record, hook score.
#
# THE MELODY IS MEASURED, NOT COMPOSED. Derived statistically from 35
# matched performances (2020–2026) of the butterfly-cosplayer song on
# @whistlegraph via toolchain/whistlegraph/melody-stats.py (plosive-safe
# syllable→note nuclei, per-take register refit, octave folding):
# downloads/imab.melody-stats.json is the evidence; this file is the
# quantized reading.
#
# Shape: a TONIC CHANT with one octave flare — the whole first line sits
# on the tonic; "flap-PING" leaps +12 (sung ~+11.6, a hair flat — keep
# the flare); "just a costume" enters on the 4th and walks down
# 4th→maj3rd→2nd (the major third puts it in MAJOR); "i put on" bumps
# the 2nd; "in my room" comes home, "room" held longest.
#
# Key: A major (corpus key consensus clusters on A/A#; tonic A).
# Sung register: tonic ≈ A3. Source tempo median ≈ 115 BPM; the DANCE
# cut runs the lane's 124.
#
# ── GROUND TRUTH from @jeffrey — notepat form (2026-08-31, definitive)
#
#   c g c c c   ·   c h c c c   ·   g f e d e e d c c c
#   (h = the high C, notepat second octave)
#
#   i'm(C4) a(G4) but-ter-fly(C4 C4 C4)
#   flap(C4)-PING(C5) for you guys(C4 C4 C4)
#   just(G4) a(F4) cos(E4)-tume(D4)
#   i(E4) put(E4) on(D4) · in my room(C4 C4 C4)
#
# (An earlier spoken pass said B-A-G-F for the costume walk; the
# notepat punch-in G-F-E-D supersedes it.) Verified render: holyvox
# notecheck all targets hit, legato glides recognized as transit.
# The stats below remain as evidence; where they disagree with the
# singer, the singer wins.
#
# ── the earlier statistical reading, quantized to 4/4 ─────────────────
#
#   bar 1   i'm(T @1)  a(T @1.75)  BUT(T @2)  ter(T @3)  fly(T @4)
#   bar 2   flap(T @1.5)  PING(T+12 @2.5, held)  for(T @3.5)  you(T @4)  guys(T @4.5)
#   bar 3   —  just(T+5 @2.5)  a(T+5 @4)  cos(T+4 @4.5)
#   bar 4   TUME(T+2 @1, held 1.5)  —  i(T+2 @3)  put(T+2 @3.5)  on(T @4)  in(T @4.5)
#   bar 5   my(T-0..-1 @1)  ROOM(T @1.5, held ~1.5)  —
#   bar 6   —  (breath / turnaround)
#
# In A: T=A3(57) · T+2=B3(59) · T+4=C#4(61) · T+5=D4(62) · T+12=A4(69).
# Fuzzy slots per the stats (write them, then let the ear rule): "on"
# median +0.8 (could be T or T+2); "my" −0.5 (T or a lower-neighbor
# G#3); costume·2/put sit at +2.5 (between 2nd and minor 3rd — the maj
# 2nd reading fits the major mode).
#
# Rhythm evidence (median inter-onset units ≈ beats): i'm 0 · a 0.72 ·
# but 1.05 · ter 1.88 · fly 2.9 · flap 4.7 · PING 5.83 · for 6.54 ·
# you 6.82 · guys 7.56 · just 9.63 · a 10.9 · cos 11.45 · tume 12.12 ·
# i 14.19 · put 14.5 · on ~14.5 · in 15.4 · my 15.92 · room 16.32.
#
# Harmony (the source is a-cappella — chant implies it): A drone under
# the chant; D (IV) under "just a costume"; back to A for the landing.
# Dance-cut progression proposal: A | A | D | D→A | A | A.
#
# Form (planned): the clubber360 palindrome — hook passes at act doors,
# kickless break, drop answering a slow smear. See README.
